{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":215,"count":34,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L04-2-21\",\"找钱\",\"找錢\",\"找钱\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他找你多少錢？","pinyin":"Tā zhǎo nǐ duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much change did he give you?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-21","sourceFront":"找錢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"找您七百八十五塊錢，謝謝。","pinyin":"Zhǎo nín qī bǎi bāshíwǔ kuài qián, xièxie.","english":"Here is your 785 dollars of change, thanks.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-11\",\"风景\",\"風景\",\"风景\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，海邊的風景也很漂亮，我想去游泳，妳們想去嗎？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, hǎibiān de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliàng, wǒ xiǎng qù yóuyǒng, nǐmen xiǎng qù ma?","english":"The weather is pretty good today, so is the view at the beach. I want to go swimming. Do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-12\",\"毛筆\",\"毛筆\",\"毛笔\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我明天要上書法課，現在要去買毛筆！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-12","sourceFront":"毛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"明天有書法課，我要帶毛筆去學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-19","sourceFront":"帶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"毛(hair) + 筆(brush) → a brush made of hair: 毛筆 is a writing brush."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-08\",\"读\",\"讀\",\"读\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L14-1-02\",\"活动\",\"活動\",\"活动\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"來台灣以後，每個週末我都有很多活動，覺得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-02","sourceFront":"活動","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你參加過什麼有趣的新年活動？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-04","sourceFront":"新年","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"明天我要跟朋友去參加跨年活動，我還沒跟父母講這件事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-03","sourceFront":"講","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"元宵節燈會是華人新年的重要活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-09","sourceFront":"燈會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個活動不好玩，大家都希望趕快結束。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-12","sourceFront":"結束","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個星期六，我們要在社區的草地上辦活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-10","sourceFront":"辦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在台灣，不少人去KTV慶祝生日或是辦活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-01","sourceFront":"不少","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"去KTV辦活動，是一個不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-20","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動辦得很成功，大家都玩得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前沒什麼人喜歡露營，可是最近露營變成了一種流行的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-30","sourceFront":"變成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天華語中心辦的中秋節活動，所有學生都來參加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-31","sourceFront":"所有","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在台灣，去KTV唱歌是很平常的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-18","sourceFront":"平常","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老人一直坐著對身體不好，應該站起來活動活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-18","sourceFront":"活動","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加社團活動，是讓自己成長的好機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"利用週末到安養院幫助老人，是很有意義的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-26","sourceFront":"意義","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語文中心的學生邀請台灣朋友來參加世界文化日的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-01","sourceFront":"邀請","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"超商常舉辦送小禮物或買一送一的活動，可是對王先生完全沒有吸引力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-10","sourceFront":"完全","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加百貨公司的活動，抽到一台價格六萬元的平板電腦， 真是太幸運了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"強烈的陽光對我們的眼睛不好，出門活動時最好戴上太陽眼鏡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-03","sourceFront":"強烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個活動會場有服務中心，想找人的話，可以請服務人員廣播。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-27","sourceFront":"廣播","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我最喜歡的休閒活動是爬山和露營","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-01","sourceFront":"休閒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動，決定在戶外舉辦，萬一下雨了就搬到室內去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老闆舉辦了一個免費吃鬆餅的活動，目的是調查哪種口味的鬆餅最受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-10","sourceFront":"調查","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"滑雪是很刺激的活動，需要很好的技巧","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-18","sourceFront":"刺激","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家動物餐廳的空間很大，可以讓客人的小動物自由自在地活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-43","sourceFront":"自由自在","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"記者說參加這次慢跑活動的人數已經超過了一百人，可是我數來數去只有五十幾個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-12","sourceFront":"數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像衝浪、滑雪那樣的戶外活動，又刺激又好玩，不用說，絕對能吸引青少年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-08","sourceFront":"不用說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的露營活動因為颱風辦不成了，可以說計畫永遠沒辦法趕上變化","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在華語中心，每個學期老師都會帶領學生參加戶外教學的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-24","sourceFront":"帶領","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得減少工作，增加有意義的休閒活動，這樣的生活比較充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-21","sourceFront":"減少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在學習中文的期間，小林下課後除了複習功課，也和同學參加了不少社團活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-02","sourceFront":"期間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次亞洲文化展，除了樂器表演，還有傳統服裝試穿活動，歡迎各位來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-01","sourceFront":"各位","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:為什麼活動中心連一個人都沒有？今天不是有吉他社的表演嗎？ B:你搞錯了，演出日期是下個星期三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-11","sourceFront":"搞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"紀先生的部落格擁有不少讀者，下個週末他要辦一場新書活動，買了新書的讀者都可以請他簽名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-09","sourceFront":"讀者","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校蓋了一棟活動中心，學生又多了一個交流、休閒的好場所了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-06","sourceFront":"蓋","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你最好別穿著拖鞋去參加正式活動，要不然別人可能認為你不懂禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-29","sourceFront":"拖鞋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的露營活動還欠什麼東西？我可以帶過來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-51","sourceFront":"欠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類過度的發展活動，已對動植物的生活環境造成嚴重破壞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-23","sourceFront":"過度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得跳舞這項活動對健康很有幫助，還可以交到很多朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-23","sourceFront":"項","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"百貨公司經常辦活動及送贈品，都是為了鼓勵客人多消費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-44","sourceFront":"贈品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們在露營活動中現學現唱了八首歌，真是了不起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-30","sourceFront":"現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家便利商店現在有「咖啡、茶飲買一送一」的優惠活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-01","sourceFront":"茶飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類活動產生許多垃圾，不但汙染了環境，更改變了全球氣候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-45","sourceFront":"汙染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天百貨公司有優惠活動，買