2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想了許多辦法去達成公司的目標，卻還是得不到主管的支持。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-32","sourceFront":"目標","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司如果關心客戶並達成他們的需求，對業務或多或少有好處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-13","sourceFront":"或多或少","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 達(reach) and 成(become): 達成 means reach."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-09\",\"讀者\",\"讀者\",\"读者\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"紀先生的部落格擁有不少讀者，下個週末他要辦一場新書活動，買了新書的讀者都可以請他簽名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-09","sourceFront":"讀者","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這家公司出版的小說，陪著不少讀者一塊兒成長，也帶給他們無窮的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-02","sourceFront":"無窮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本書有豐富的內容及生動的鉛筆畫，是吸引讀者購買的主要原因。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-07","sourceFront":"及","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Engaged in 讀(study) as one of 者(those who): 讀者 means reader."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-20\",\"情形\",\"情形\",\"情形\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這座地下停車場因為缺乏經費，沒辦法改善又暗又溼的情形。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-23","sourceFront":"暗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"Observing the genuine 情(feeling) reality and visible 形(shape) of events: 情形 means situation."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-37\",\"時常\",\"時常\",\"时常\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"叔叔時常跟我聊他到世界各地旅行的故事，真是有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-37","sourceFront":"時常","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我已經退休了，不過還時常跟幾位要好的同事通信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-42","sourceFront":"通信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他做事很慢，時常要人催他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-20","sourceFront":"催","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一家餐廳要是受歡迎，就算把店關在郊區的某個小巷子裡，也還是時常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-05","sourceFront":"巷子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家中式點心店的紅豆沙包子又香又甜，我時常買來當作早餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-28","sourceFront":"沙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他上班時常戴著一副黑色眼鏡，那副樣子總是讓我忘不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-39","sourceFront":"副","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機廠商時常邀請明星替他們的產品宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-14","sourceFront":"廠商","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他是華僑，說中文時常帶點兒當地的口音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-06","sourceFront":"華僑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店時常在過節時舉辦降價活動來吸引顧客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-07","sourceFront":"過節","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-46\",\"可是\",\"可是\",\"可是\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我有手機，可是沒有電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu shǒujī, kěshì méiyǒu diànnǎo.","english":"I have a cell phone, but I don’t have any computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-10","sourceFront":"手機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家店的冰淇淋很好吃，可是有點兒貴。","pinyin":"Nà jiā diàn de bīngqílín hěn hǎochī, kěshì yǒudiǎnr guì.","english":"That store has delicious ice cream, but it is a bit expensive.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-06","sourceFront":"有（一）點（兒）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這棟房子不大，可是很貴。","pinyin":"Zhè dòng fángzi bú dà, kěshì hěn guì.","english":"This is not a big house, but very expensive.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-05","sourceFront":"房子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我想去朋友家玩，可是沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng qù péngyǒu jiā wán, kěshì méi yǒukòng.","english":"I would like to go to my friend’s place, but I don’t have time.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-02","sourceFront":"可是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"越南也有十二生肖，可是我們沒有兔年，有貓年。我是貓年出生的，屬貓。","pinyin":"Yuènán yě yǒu shí'èr shēngxiào, kěshì wǒmen méi yǒu tù nián, yǒu māo nián. Wǒ shì māo nián chūshēng de, shǔ māo.","english":"There are also zodiac signs in Vietnam, but we don’t have the year of the Rabbit; we have the year of the Cat. I was born in the year of the Cat, which means my zodiac animal sign is cat.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是這些時間我都有語言交換，不能去。","pinyin":"Kěshì zhèxiē shíjiān wǒ dōu yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, bù néng qù.","english":"But I will be doing language exchange during that time. I can’t make it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是從四點到五點半我要上英文課，六點去，怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Kěshì cóng sì diǎn dào wǔ diǎn bàn wǒ yào shàng Yīngwén kè, liù diǎn qù, zěnmeyàng?","english":"But I have an English class from 4 to 5:30 p.m. How about 6 p.m.?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很多年輕男生愛在書店看汽車雜誌，汽車很貴，他們不一定可以買新車，可是都看得很開心。","pinyin":"Hěn duō niánqīng nánshēng ài zài shūdiàn kàn qìchē zázhì, qìchē hěn guì, tāmen bù yídìng kěyǐ mǎi xīn chē, kěshì dōu kàn de hěn kāixīn.","english":"Many young men like to read car magazines at bookstores. Cars are expensive and they don’t usually have the money to buy new ones; however, they are very happy just by reading those magazines.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我覺得有的舊東西很不錯，有的新東西也很有趣，我很喜歡看新車、新衣服，可是因為我的錢不多，所以我不常買。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde yǒude jiù dōngxi hěn búcuò, yǒude xīn dōngxi yě hěn yǒuqù, wǒ hěn xǐhuān kàn xīn chē, xīn yīfu, kěshì yīnwèi wǒ de qián bù duō, suǒyǐ wǒ bù cháng mǎi.","english":"I think some old stuff is good and some new ones are interesting. I like to check the new car, new clothes out, but I do not have much money, so I don’t buy them often.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"聽說這個牌子的東西很貴，可是很多人喜歡。","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè ge páizi de dōngxi hěn guì, kěshì hěn duō rén xǐhuān.","english":"I heard that this clothing brand is very expensive, but a lot of people like it.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我很想去看，可是我最近胖了五公斤，我怕衣服不好買。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn xiǎng qù kàn, kěshì wǒ zuìjìn pàng le wǔ gōngjīn, wǒ pà yīfu bù hǎo mǎi.","english":"I would like to check it out. But I have recently gained 5 kilograms, so I am worried that they don’t have my size.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是我覺得那裡有點兒遠，走路去太累了。","pinyin":"Kěshì wǒ juéde nàlǐ yǒudiǎnr yuǎn, zǒulù qù tài lèi le.","english":"But I think it’s a bit far. It’s too tiring to get there on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是我不知道怎麼走，妳知道嗎？","pinyin":"Kěshì wǒ bù zhīdào zěnme zǒu, nǐ zhīdào ma?","english":"But I don’t know how to get there, do you?","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是我只想聽音樂、睡覺。","pinyin":"Kěshì wǒ zhǐ xiǎng tīng yīnyuè, shuìjiào.","english":"But I only want to listen to music and sleep.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我會游泳，可是游得不太好。","pinyin":"Wǒ huì yóuyǒng, kěshì yóu de bú tài hǎo.","english":"I can swim, but not very well.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"媽，我跟友美要去喝下午茶，可是我的錢包不在房間裡。","pinyin":"Mā, wǒ gēn Yǒuměi yào qù hē xiàwǔ chá, kěshì wǒ de qiánbāo bú zài fángjiān lǐ.","english":"Mom, Youmei and I are going to have afternoon tea now, but my wallet is not in the bedroom.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"可(can) + 是(be) → 'it can be so → but...': 可是 means 'but'."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-2-12\",\"握手\",\"握手\",\"握手\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"跟別人握手時，握得太久或太緊都是沒有禮貌的行為。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-12","sourceFront":"握手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-01\",\"碰見\",\"碰見\",\"碰见\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去澳洲登山時，碰見了正在自助旅行的老朋友，真巧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-01","sourceFront":"碰見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次活動大家都化裝參加，要是你碰見我大概認不出我是誰。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-03","sourceFront":"化裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-2-05\",\"漫画\",\"漫畫\",\"漫画\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-24\",\"特别\",\"特別\",\"特别\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我記得有羊、馬、兔子……，最特別的是龍。（打開課本）妳看看……","pinyin":"Wǒ jìdé yǒu yáng, mǎ, tùzi..., zuì tèbié de shì lóng. (dǎkāi kèběn) Nǐ kànkan...","english":"I remember there are goats, horses, rabbits..., and the most special one is the dragon. (Open the textbook) You see...","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-40\",\"血管\",\"血管\",\"血管\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天上健康教育課時，老師在教室裡掛了一張人體血管圖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-40","sourceFront":"血管","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"腦部血管很複雜，做腦部手術時不能有任何的差錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-24","sourceFront":"差錯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-03\",\"展览\",\"展覽\",\"展览\",\"V/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家博物館平日展覽的物品很多，中多半與古代科技有關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-03","sourceFront":"展覽","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"國立博物館正在展覽公元三百年左右的古文物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-01","sourceFront":"公元","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-17\",\"出色\",\"出色\",\"出色\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"孫小姐最近談成了幾筆大生意，表現出色，於是公司決定提高她的薪水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-17","sourceFront":"出色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們學校的啦啦隊隊員個子都很高，舞蹈的技巧也很出色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-51","sourceFront":"隊員","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"元\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 一(one) bill drops onto a 兀(weak) tray → one 元(dollar)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"千\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 十(ten) farmer stacks ten bundles of grain into one pile → 千(thousand)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"籃\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 竹(bamboo) weave waits while 監(to inspect) watches → 籃(basket)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"缺乏\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 缺(lack) and 乏(poor): 缺乏 means be short of, to lack."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"錯誤\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 錯(a mistake) and 誤(error): 錯誤 means mistake."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"難忘\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Difficult and 難(hard) to 忘(forget): 難忘 means memorable."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"高中\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 高(tall) and 中(middle): 高中 means senior high school."}]}
